{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/key-a-title-s-scale-walk",
  "seed": "The Properties pane beside a title lists only what is animating. This walk opens a recording at Next defaults with no flag changed, types a title on it, picks Scale from Animate a property and keys it at two moments the way Premiere does: picking starts keying with a key at the playhead, a new value typed at a later moment is a second key, the diamond is hollow between them and filled on them and adds or takes off the key under the playhead, the arrows step between them, undo takes a key back in one step, and the row's cross turns keying off, asking first.",
  "setup": {
    "forget": [
      "all"
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "openSampleRecording"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "videoPause"
    },
    {
      "do": "tool",
      "tool": "select"
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "videoSeekMiddle"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "tool",
      "tool": "text"
    },
    {
      "do": "click",
      "at": [
        620,
        330
      ]
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "do": "type",
      "text": "Launch day"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.5
    },
    {
      "do": "key",
      "key": "return",
      "modifiers": [
        "command"
      ]
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 1.0
    },
    {
      "do": "reveal",
      "control": "Properties section"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.5
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "1-nothing-keyed",
      "note": "THE FIRST TEST, at Next defaults: a title typed on a recording, and the panel opens on Properties: the title's clip line (its name, in, out, length and speed), then Animating, which says nothing yet and lists no rows. 'How do I animate this?' has one visible answer: Animate a property"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "field": "Properties Kind",
      "reads": "Title"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "field": "Clip line",
      "present": true
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "field": "Animating Count",
      "reads": "nothing yet"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "present": false
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Animate a property"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Text size",
      "in": "Animate a property",
      "present": true
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Shadow size",
      "in": "Animate a property",
      "present": true
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "1b-the-picker"
    },
    {
      "do": "panel",
      "stage": "1-nothing-keyed"
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "1-a-title-nothing-keyed"
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "1b-the-picker",
      "note": "Animate a property opens a picker of every value the title is not animating, grouped Transform, Appearance, Effects, Text and Crop, with a box to find one by name. Scale is picked from it"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Scale",
      "in": "Animate a property"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "2-keying",
      "note": "THE SECOND TEST: picking Scale starts keying it with a key at the playhead, and its row joins Animating with the diamond filled, because a key sits right here"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "on a key"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "field": "Animating Count",
      "reads": "1 of 8 properties"
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "videoSeekThreeQuarters"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "between keys"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Scale Value"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.3
    },
    {
      "do": "key",
      "key": "a",
      "modifiers": [
        "command"
      ]
    },
    {
      "do": "type",
      "text": "160"
    },
    {
      "do": "key",
      "key": "return"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "3-second-key",
      "note": "THE THIRD TEST: two seconds later, typing 160 into Scale is a second key, not a new still size. There is no Add Key button: changing a keyed value at another moment is what adds one"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "on a key"
    },
    {
      "do": "panel",
      "stage": "3-second-key"
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "2-second-key-at-160"
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "videoStepBackOneSecond"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "4-between",
      "note": "THE FOURTH TEST: a second back, between the two keys. The diamond is hollow and coloured, the value reads on its way from 100 to 160, and the title on the canvas is part way grown"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "between keys"
    },
    {
      "do": "panel",
      "stage": "4-between"
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "3-between-the-keys"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Previous Key",
      "in": "Scale"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "5-stepped-back",
      "note": "THE FIFTH TEST: the left arrow puts the playhead on the key before, and the diamond fills again"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "on a key"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Next Key",
      "in": "Scale"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "on a key"
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "4-stepped-to-the-next-key"
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "undo"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "6-undone",
      "note": "THE SIXTH TEST: one undo takes the second key away in one step, and the first stays"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "field": "Animating Count",
      "reads": "1 of 8 properties"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "between keys"
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "redo"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "on a key"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "6b-diamond-off",
      "note": "THE DIAMOND IS PREMIERE'S KEYFRAME BUTTON: clicking it on a key takes that key off; the value stays animating on its other key"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "between keys"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "field": "Animating Count",
      "reads": "1 of 8 properties"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "reads": "on a key"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Stop Animating",
      "in": "Scale"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "7-asks",
      "note": "THE SEVENTH TEST: the row's cross, stopping a value with two keys, asks before losing them"
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "5-stop-animating-asks"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Remove Keys",
      "in": "Sheet"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "field": "Animating Count",
      "reads": "nothing yet"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Scale",
      "present": false
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "8-stopped",
      "note": "keying is off, the Scale row has left Animating, and the title keeps the size it had at the playhead rather than jumping back"
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "6-keying-off-keeps-the-size"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Animate a property"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Position",
      "in": "Animate a property"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Position",
      "reads": "on a key"
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "videoStepBackOneSecond"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Position",
      "reads": "between keys"
    },
    {
      "do": "tool",
      "tool": "select"
    },
    {
      "do": "drag",
      "from": [
        720,
        350
      ],
      "to": [
        900,
        420
      ],
      "space": "document",
      "steps": 10
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "9-dragged-on-the-canvas",
      "note": "THE EIGHTH TEST: with Position keyed, dragging the title on the canvas a second earlier is a second Position key where the hand left it, not a move of the whole title. The diamond fills, and the arrows now have somewhere to go"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Position",
      "reads": "on a key"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "field": "Animating Count",
      "reads": "1 of 8 properties"
    },
    {
      "do": "panel",
      "stage": "9-dragged"
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "7-a-drag-is-a-position-key"
    },
    {
      "do": "press",
      "control": "Next Key",
      "in": "Position"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "10-back-where-it-was",
      "note": "a second later, on the first Position key, the title is back where it was keyed: the drag moved only the moment it was made at"
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "8-the-first-key-is-untouched"
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "undo"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Key",
      "in": "Position",
      "reads": "on a key"
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "11-drag-undone",
      "note": "one undo takes the dragged key back, and the one set with the diamond stays"
    }
  ]
}
